msgstr "contact PATIA by WhatsApp"

#: app/templates/legal.html:39
msgid ""
"Este documento explica de forma general qué información utiliza PATIA. Es un"
" borrador operativo sujeto a revisión legal y no afirma cumplimiento o "
"certificaciones que no hayan sido verificadas."
msgstr ""
"This document explains in general terms what information PATIA uses. It is "
"an operational draft subject to legal review and does not claim compliance "
"or certifications that have not been verified."

